Error [E0202]: Parameter `counter` requires the write-access marker `&` at the call site
  --> tests/ui/write_param_struct_forwarded_bare.jet:10:10
    |
 10 |     bump(counter)
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: `bump` needs to edit this value with the write-access marker `&`; passing it without that marker grants only read access
 Fix: Write the write-access marker `&` (`&counter`) when calling `bump`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0202
